  "details": "OSC stops recieving events if I reload my avatar (e.g toggling fbt/locomotion animations) while I have OSC applications sending to VRChat (port 9000).\nIt only happens sometimes but its enough to be annoying. The only fix is a game restart. I am able to replicate the issue pretty consistently by running a few OSC apps and then toggling avatar locomotion animations on/off repeatedly. OSC eventually breaks and no events are recieved anymore.",
